 THE 2026 WALL: who can MEASURE internal sigma of the carriers?
====================================================================================================
   DESI blue (R=2000)      : instrumental sigma floor ~  63.7 km/s  vs carriers at 8-20 km/s -> BELOW FLOOR (cannot measure)
   DESI red/NIR (R=5500)   : instrumental sigma floor ~  23.1 km/s  vs carriers at 8-20 km/s -> BELOW FLOOR (cannot measure)
   SDSS (R~2000)           : instrumental sigma floor ~  63.7 km/s  vs carriers at 8-20 km/s -> BELOW FLOOR (cannot measure)
   MUSE (R~3000 @ 7000A)   : instrumental sigma floor ~  42.4 km/s  vs carriers at 8-20 km/s -> BELOW FLOOR (cannot measure)
   ELT-HARMONI (R~18000)   : instrumental sigma floor ~   7.1 km/s  vs carriers at 8-20 km/s -> marginal/OK
   => DESI (DR1 public; DR2 NOT public as of 2026-07-16, verified 401) measures member
      REDSHIFTS (v_los to ~10-30 km/s -- excellent for PPS infall tagging) and internal sigma
      ONLY for sigma >~ 60-100 km/s members. Those members are ADIABATIC-DEAD by the same MI
      physics (y <~ 0.3, a_in >~ 0.5 a0): predicted spread ~0.1-0.7% (rederive script (4)).
   dE route quantified: f~0.7%, best SDSS-quality errors -> N_3sigma ~ 102,041
   vs ~959 members with sigma in Sohn+2017 A2029-class catalogs -> shortfall x106.
   => The ensemble-sigma route through bright members is DEAD; no firewall bypass exists.
====================================================================================================
 2026 AVAILABLE vs NEEDED (the honest gap)
====================================================================================================
   Carriers with ANY internal sigma today: 38 UDGs total (Gannon+2024 living catalog,
   downloaded + counted in census_verify.py), of which ~24 are in cluster/group environments;
   per-object errors 16-45%. LEWIS Hydra-I adds ~6-12 'constrained' as papers land.
     NEEDED (3 sigma vs MG=0): ~270-903 infall-tagged, outer-shell, undisrupted carriers
       with <~10% sigma errors  ->  GAP: x15-60 in N *at a precision tier that does not exist yet*.
     With TODAY'S 20-40% errors the same test needs N~3125 -> gap x130.
   VERDICT: STILL UNDERPOWERED in 2026 -- and the DESI DR1/DR2 wave does not change the binding
   constraint (it upgrades the free side: membership + phase tagging for thousands of clusters).
   Any firing on today's ~24 objects is EXPLORATORY/FIREWALLED (cannot support or kill).

 EXIT 0 = estimator specified; power grid + gap quantified; banked 100-180 recovered as the
 upper-band/no-interloper idealized corner (N~134); honest requirement N~270-900.
